<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Break It Off - Bonus</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PinkPantheress</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">to hell with it</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">78ul3D77noQsYjSwvwiPU1</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.540" end="00:13.040">No one ever saw me cry (cry)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.140" end="00:15.920">Until I left the party the other night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.920" end="00:18.470">Do you remember all the things that you said to me? (Me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.470" end="00:21.180">That came out of his mouth automatically ('cally)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.180" end="00:25.000">But I'm so used to saying, "I'm fine"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.000" end="00:26.940">And then something that you did to hurt me worse</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.940" end="00:30.700">It comes to me, despite (those times)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.700" end="00:35.570">One day, I just wanna hear you say, "I like you"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.570" end="00:38.060">What's stopping you? Ah-ah-ah-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.060" end="00:41.070">What's stopping you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.070" end="00:43.870">What's stopping you? Ah-ah-ah-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.870" end="00:45.370">What's stopping you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.830" end="00:50.000">Wish I could go back to lying beside you on the bed (why did I like you, breaking it off)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.000" end="00:54.530">I'm out here thinking about every bad mistake I made (why did I like you, breaking it off)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.530" end="00:58.300">But I'm so used to saying, "I'm fine"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.300" end="01:00.620">And then something that you did to hurt me worse</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.620" end="01:04.230">It comes to me, despite (those times)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.230" end="01:08.940">One day, I just wanna hear you say, "I like you"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.940" end="01:14.440">What's stopping you? (Hey!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.440" end="01:20.320">What's stopping you? Ah-ah-ah-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.320" end="01:23.360">What's stopping you? (Why did I like you, breaking it off)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.360" end="01:25.680">What's stopping you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.680" end="01:30.160">What's stopping you? (Why did I like you, breaking if off)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.160" end="01:34.160" /></div></body></tt>